WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Crouching medium punch starts the conversion.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.650
Crouching heavy punch and heavy Stribog launch Ryu.

3
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.750
Medium Torbalan catches the long-range juggle.

4
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.800
Medium-plus-heavy-punch OD Triglav extends the airborne sequence.

5
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.550
A final heavy Triglav catches the juggle.

6
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.900
Heavy Departure is placed above the final knockdown.
